@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members
title Patrón Facade
class ReporteController
class ReporteFacade {
  - plantillas : RegistroPlantillas
  - director : DirectorReporte
  + generarReporte(tipo, fecha, conSello, marcaAgua, conFirma) : Reporte
}
class RegistroPlantillas
class DirectorReporte
class SelloFerreteriaDecorador
class MarcaAguaDecorador
class FirmaDecorador
ReporteController --> ReporteFacade : un solo método
ReporteFacade --> RegistroPlantillas : 1. Prototype
ReporteFacade --> DirectorReporte : 2. Builder y Composite
ReporteFacade ..> SelloFerreteriaDecorador : 3. Decorator
ReporteFacade ..> MarcaAguaDecorador
ReporteFacade ..> FirmaDecorador
@enduml
